 "intro_html": "Made with the <b>bigger niboshi</b> (dried anchovies), not the tiny baby ones — heads and guts pulled out so the dashi stays sweet instead of bitter. <b>Katsuobushi</b> (bonito flakes) steeped at the end rounds it out. This is the one for <a href=\"oyakodon.html\">oyakodon</a> and <a href=\"tamagoyaki.html\">tamagoyaki</a>.",
