 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>You weren’t sure whether bonito went into yours.</li><li>Niboshi plus katsuobushi is the standard combination; for a pure niboshi dashi, skip step 5 — it’s lighter and more anchovy-forward.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Bonito or not?"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"20\" data-s=\"0\">20 g</span> niboshi and <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"15\" data-b=\"20\" data-s=\"0\">15–20 g</span> katsuobushi per litre are starting points, not your measured amounts.</p>",
   "title_html": "Amounts"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Fridge 3–4 days, or freeze in ice-cube trays.</p>",
   "title_html": "Storage"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>See <a href=\"shiitake-kombu-dashi.html\">shiitake–kombu dashi</a>.</p>",
   "title_html": "Vegan dashi"
  }
 ],
