     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"15\" data-b=\"20\">15–20 g</span> — see note",
     "name_html": "Katsuobushi (bonito flakes)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour through a fine sieve.</li><li><b>Don’t press the flakes</b>: squeezing makes the dashi cloudy and fishy.</li></ul>",
